            HoldForm], TraditionalForm]], "InlineMath", ScriptLevel -> 0, 
         FractionBoxOptions -> {BaseStyle -> {ScriptLevel -> 0}}], " is the \
supplied vector potential. Their onsite modulation is zero."}], "Notes", 
      CellID -> 1068187451], 
     Cell[TextData[{"The two-element vector-potential form assumes amplitude \
", Cell[BoxData["1"], "InlineFormula", FontFamily -> "Source Sans Pro"], 
        ". Use ", Cell[BoxData[ButtonBox["PhotonDress", BaseStyle -> "Link", 
           ButtonData -> "paclet:TBMethod/ref/PhotonDress"]], 
         "InlineFormula", FontFamily -> "Source Sans Pro"], 
        " to combine these factors with a bare hopping matrix."}], "Notes", 
      CellID -> 1882469776], Cell[TextData[{"Fourier coefficients are \
